# The Mended Sleeve
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
Hold still. The thread keeps catching.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
You do not have to mend my coat.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
And you do not have to carry every difficult thing yourself.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
That is not quite the same.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
No. But it is where I can start.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
The repaired seam is crooked and stronger than it was.
